{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WELCOME TO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833700/extras/About_Header.png?t=1745347928\" /><strong>In a glorious past, the kingdom of Meritons shone with wisdom and prosperity. But after centuries, the whole dynasty's been falling apart. The governance of the kingdom has crumbled, injustices have multiplied, and many citizens have been forced to leave a system that has become unfair and outdated.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833700/extras/Header_-_Streets.gif?t=1745347928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unfairly blacklisted by the banks, you joined a small group in a camp near the city.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>To survive, we\u2019ll have to help each other and stick to the camp rules. Water, electricity, cleaning and rat hunting. Everything counts!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833700/extras/Header_-_Village_Help.gif?t=1745347928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833700/extras/Header_-_Village_Help_2_Still.png?t=1745347928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Outcasts, but not alone! Team up with your campmates for the riskiest tasks. High risk, high reward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833700/extras/Header_-_Missions_Still.png?t=1745347928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Corruption rules, resources are running low, and the competition outside the camp is brutal. Don\u2019t let anyone push you around. You're going to have to fight!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833700/extras/Header_-_Missions_2_Still.png?t=1745347928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Their system is falling apart. But to protect their power, the Meritons will use their media to smear your name.</strong>\u00a0<strong>Your last hope is to get attention on social media to make your cause heard! You have nothing left to lose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833700/extras/Header_-_Media_Still.png?t=1745347928\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong><br><i><strong>Make Them Stop: Act I</strong></i><strong> features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The introduction and the first chapter (about 1.5 hours)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A continuous flow of quests and missions (until the last mission of the demo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An introduction to the semi-open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multi-paced gameplay: camp maintenance tasks, combat, protests, stealth</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is still in development, follow the journey on our Discord server!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2833700?t=1745347928","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2833700?t=1745347928","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833700/c8c84d786059b37b8354eedfc7b20e87ebbb4515/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745347928","cap